# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback for the installable PWA target.
# Pages serves an existing static asset first and only falls through to this
# rule when no file matches, so sw.js, manifest.webmanifest, /fonts/* and
# /assets/* still serve as themselves. This is the equivalent of the Vercel
# rewrite in vercel.json (which Cloudflare does not read).
# Needed on first load (before the service worker installs) and whenever the
# manifest start_url /mobile/lists is fetched by the browser/OS.
/*    /index.html    200
